# Round 18, C1-16 (follows): charged's at reads surprise_dom, law-dated, so an ask line that reaches charged states
# law (L §4.3, §5.18 law D: "a chain of readers stops at a def with a written at e, except for what e itself reads").
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input surprise_dom: int
input fee: money PLN
def charged[m in months]: money PLN = fee at day_of(m, surprise_dom)
version v1
  cite s
  governs 2026-01..2026-06
  known 2025-12-01
  surprise_dom = 10
  fee = 5
version v2
  cite s
  governs 2026-07..
  known 2025-12-01
  surprise_dom = 20
  fee = 7
ask q: charged[2026-03]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE ask q reaches charged, whose at reads law-dated facts at its reader's law date, without law (L §4.3) (m.tally:23)
